hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1724","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye aayat tilaawat ki: (Wahi hai jis ne tum par Kitaab naazil ki, us mein mohkam aayatein hain jo Kitaab ki jad hain aur doosri mutashaabeh hain. Phir jo unkey dilon mein tedhaapan hai wo us mein mutashaabeh ki pairwi kartey hain, fitna chaahtey huey aur uski taaweel chaaahtey huey. Aur uski taaweel Allah key siwa koi nahi jaanta. Aur ilm mein pakkay kehtey hain: Ham us par imaan laaey, sab hamaarey Rab ki taraf se hai. Aur aqal walon key siwa nasihat nahi pakadtey). Unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir jab tum unhey dekho jo us mein mutashaabeh ki pairwi kartey hain to wahi hain jinkay Allah ne naam liya hai. To un se bacho. (Bukhari: 4547). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Beshak jo Allah key ahd aur apni qasmon key badley thodi qeemat khareedtey hain unkey liye koi hissa nahi)."
"1725","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke do auratein jhagadten jo ghar ya hujrey mein seeti theen. To un mein se aik nikli jabke uski hatheli mein suja chubhoya hua tha. To us ne doosri par daawa kya. To Ibn Abbas key paas muqadma laaya gaya. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar logon ko unkey daawon se diya jaata to qaum key khoon aur maal chalay jaatey. Use Allah yaad dilaao aur us par padho: (Beshak jo Allah key ahd se khareedtey hain). To unhon-ne use yaad dilaaya aur us ne iqraar kar liya. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam muddaa alaih par hai. (Bukhari: 4552). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Beshak logon ne tumhaarey liye jama kya hai) aayat."
"1726","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai: (Hamein Allah kaafi hai aur wo behtareen Kaarsaaz hai). Use Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) ne kaha tha jab wo aag mein daaley gaey. Aur use Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaha tha jab unhon-ne kaha: (Beshak logon ne tumhaarey liye jama kya hai, to un se daro. To unkey imaan mein izaafa hua aur unhon-ne kaha: Hamein Allah kaafi hai aur wo behtareen Kaarsaaz hai). (Bukhari: 4563). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur tum zaroor un se jo tum se pehley Kitaab diye gaey aur jinhon-ne shirk kya bahut takleef sunogey)."
"1727","[AI-translation] Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) gadhey par sawaar huey jis par Fadak ki qateefa thi. Aur Usaama bin Zaid ko apne peechey sawaar kya taake Bani Haaris bin Khazraj mein Saad bin Ubaada ki ayaadat karein, Badr ki ladai se pehley. Yahan tak ke majlis key paas se guzrey jismein Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salool tha. Aur wo Abdullah bin Ubayy key Musalman honay se pehley tha. Phir majlis mein Musalmaanon aur mushrikeen, but poojney walon aur Yahood aur Musalmaanon key milay julay they. Aur majlis mein Abdullah bin Rawaaha they. Phir jab sawaari key gubaar ne majlis ko dhaanp liya to Abdullah bin Ubayy ne apni naak apni chaadar se dhaanp li. Phir us ne kaha: Ham par gubaar na udaao! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey salaam kya. Phir thehrey aur utrey aur unhey Allah ki daawat di aur un par Quran padha. To Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salool ne kaha: Ae aadmi! Beshak jo tum kehtey ho us se behtar kuchh nahi hai. Agar wo haq hai to hamein uskey sath hamaari majlis mein takleef na do. Apne thikaaney ki taraf wapas jao, jo tumharey paas aaey use sunaao. To Abdullah bin Rawaaha ne kaha: Kyun nahi Ya Rasulullah! Hamein uskey sath hamaari majlison mein ghero, beshak ham use pasand kartey hain. To Musalman aur mushrikeen aur Yahood gaali galoch karney lagey yahan tak ke wo ladney lagey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhey naram kartey rahey yahan tak ke wo khaamosh ho gaey. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni sawaari par sawaar huey aur chaley yahan tak ke Saad bin Ubaada key paas daakhil huey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Ae Saad! Kya tum ne nahi suna jo Abu Hubaab ne kaha? Abdullah bin Ubayy ka iraada kartey huey. Us ne kaha: Aisa aisa. Saad bin Ubaada ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Use maaf kar do aur darguzar karo. Qasam us zaat ki jis ne tum par Kitaab naazil ki! Beshak Allah haq ley kar aaya hai jo us ne tum par naazil kya. Beshak is talab key rehne walon ne sulah ki thi ke wo use taaj pehnaaengey aur use amaama baandhengey. Phir jab Allah ne usey us haq key sath radd kar diya jo Allah ne tumhey diya to wo us se jalan rakhney laga. To us ne uskey sath waisa kya jo tum ne dekha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use maaf kar diya. Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba mushrikeen aur Kitaab walon se maaf kartey they jaisa Allah ne unhey hukm diya tha aur takleef par sabr kartey they. Allah ne farmaya: (Aur tum zaroor un se jo tum se pehley Kitaab diye gaey aur jinhon-ne shirk kya bahut takleef sunogey) aayat. Aur Allah ne farmaya: (Kitaab walon mein se bahut chaaahtey hain ke tumhey tumhaarey imaan key baad kaafir bana dein, apne paas se hasad se) aayat key aakhir tak. Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maafi ki taaweel kartey they jo Allah ne Aap ko hukm diya tha. Yahan tak ke Allah ne unkey baarey mein ijazat di. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Badr ka ghazwa kya aur Allah ne uskey sath Quraish key kaafiron key sardaaron ko qatl kya to Ibn Ubayy bin Salool aur uskey sath mushrikeen aur but poojney walon ne kaha: Ye muamla mutawajjeh ho gaya hai. To unhon-ne Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Islam par baiat ki aur wo Musalman ho gaey. (Bukhari: 4566). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Unhey gumaan na karo jo khush hotey hain jo unhon-ne kya)."
"1728","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein munaafiqon mein se aadmi they jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghazwe ki taraf nikaltey to wo Aap se peechey rehtey aur apne baithney par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey khush hotey. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laatey to Aap se uzr kartey aur qasmein khaatey aur pasand kartey ke unki tareef ki jaey jo unhon-ne nahi kya. To naazil hui: (Unhey gumaan na karo jo khush hotey hain jo unhon-ne kya aur pasand kartey hain ke unki tareef ki jaey jo unhon-ne nahi kya) aayat. (Bukhari: 4567)"
"1729","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, aur un se kaha gaya tha: Beshak agar har aadmi jo khush hua jo use diya gaya aur pasand kya ke uski tareef ki jaey jo us ne nahi kya azaab diya jaaeyga to ham sab azaab diye jaaengey. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Tumhey iskey sath kya kaam! Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yahood ko bulaaya aur un se cheez key baarey mein poochha. To unhon-ne usey Aap se chhupaaya aur Aap ko uskey siwa khabar di. To unhon-ne Aap ko dikhaaya ke wo us se khush huey jo unhon-ne Aap ko uskey baarey mein khabar di jismein Aap ne un se poochha tha. Aur wo khush huey jo unhey unkey chhupaane mein diya gaya tha. (Bukhari: 4568). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur agar tumhey khauf ho ke tum yateemon mein insaaf na karogey)."
